# Neutral sugars are conductivity controls
register lv2
add v1 water 250mL
add v1 glucose 0.001mol
measure v1 conductivity
new
add v2 water 250mL
add v2 glucose 0.002mol
measure v2 conductivity
new
add v3 water 250mL
add v3 sucrose 0.001mol
measure v3 conductivity
new
add v4 water 250mL
add v4 sucrose 0.002mol
measure v4 conductivity
# The sugars remain neutral molecules in this model. Impurities, water
# autoionisation, probe background, calibration and temperature are omitted.
